            <div class="ver"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><circle cx="11" cy="11" r="7"/><path d="M20 20l-3.5-3.5M11 8v6M8 11h6"/></svg>Toque para ampliar a planta</div>
